WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.209
A Claude Code session as it’s saved: one JSON record per line.

00:00:05.209 --> 00:00:10.210
Unroll opens the same file as a conversation.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:17.670
Each tool call links to its result.

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:22.000
Check the exact JSON record behind any message.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.160
Or open its line in the file, beside the preview.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:33.626
Search messages, tool names, arguments and results.

00:00:33.626 --> 00:00:41.206
Leave it open while an agent works. New steps appear as they’re written.

00:00:41.206 --> 00:00:47.696
A dataset of runs gets a list with each run’s outcome.

00:00:47.696 --> 00:00:52.296
Each run’s model, outcome and cost sit above its conversation.
